.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
localsearch \- Control and query the LocalSearch indexer
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
localsearch COMMAND
.fi
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The LocalSearch indexer is a background service\&. This command line utility allows controlling it as well as querying its state or searching for specific data\&.
.SH "COMMANDS"
.PP
\fBhelp\fR
.RS 4
Show help on subcommands\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBextract\fR
.RS 4
Extract metadata from a file\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBindex\fR
.RS 4
List and change indexed folders\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBinfo\fR
.RS 4
Retrieve information available for files and resources\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBinhibit\fR
.RS 4
Inhibit indexing temporarily\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBreset\fR
.RS 4
Erase the indexed data\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBsearch\fR
.RS 4
Search for content\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBstatus\fR
.RS 4
Provide status and statistics on the data indexed\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBtag\fR
.RS 4
Add, remove and list tags\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBtest\-sandbox\fR
.RS 4
Sandbox for a testing environment\&.
.RE
